# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for Tile2D.
#
# Vulkan implementations run their own worker threads (SwiftShader, a software rasterizer, is the
# noisiest one; the loader adds a few more). ThreadSanitizer reports races inside that code which say
# nothing about Tile2D: they appear with or without our renderer, and those libraries are not built
# with instrumentation. Suppressing them keeps the signal on our own threads - the server thread, the
# client thread and the shared memory channel.
race:libvk_swiftshader
race:libvulkan
